@startuml
title 10 - Purchase Order Service Blocks (Overview)
autonumber

actor "Frontend / Postman" as FE
participant "Gateway :8099" as GW
participant "PO Service :8094" as PO
database "PO DB" as PDB
participant "Auth Service :8091" as AUTH

group 1) Master Data (CURM / DEPM / POVM / PRDM / VPMP / CCEM)
  FE -> GW: POST /api/v1/po/currencies/*
  FE -> GW: POST /api/v1/po/departments/*
  FE -> GW: POST /api/v1/po/vendors/*
  FE -> GW: POST /api/v1/po/products/*
  FE -> GW: POST /api/v1/po/vendor-products/*
  FE -> GW: POST /api/v1/po/cost-centers/*
  GW -> PO: Forward
  PO -> PDB: CRUD + filter + status
  PO -> AUTH: /internal/role-page-tasks/{roleCode}/get
  PO --> FE: response
end

group 2) Request Flow (PORC / PORM / PORA)
  FE -> GW: POST /api/v1/po/request-create/*
  FE -> GW: POST /api/v1/po/request-management/*
  FE -> GW: POST /api/v1/po/request-approval/*
  GW -> PO: Forward
  PO -> PDB: DRAFT -> SUBMITTED -> APPROVED/REJECTED
  PO --> FE: response
end

group 3) Purchase Order Flow (POCR / POMG / POVC)
  FE -> GW: POST /api/v1/po/po-creation/*
  FE -> GW: POST /api/v1/po/po-management/*
  FE -> GW: POST /api/v1/po/po-vendor-confirmation/*
  GW -> PO: Forward
  PO -> PDB: APPROVED request -> DRAFT PO -> SENT
  PO -> PDB: SENT -> VENDOR_CONFIRMED/\nPARTIALLY_APPROVED/VENDOR_REJECTED
  PO --> FE: response
end

group 4) Downstream Flow (POGR / POIR / POTM / POPY / POCL)
  FE -> GW: POST /api/v1/po/goods-receipt/*
  FE -> GW: POST /api/v1/po/invoice-receipt/*
  FE -> GW: POST /api/v1/po/three-way-match/*
  FE -> GW: POST /api/v1/po/payment/*
  FE -> GW: POST /api/v1/po/closure/*
  GW -> PO: Forward
  PO -> PDB: Receive goods + invoices
  PO -> PDB: Match PO vs GRN vs Invoice
  PO -> PDB: Store cheque payments + close PO
  PO --> FE: response
end

group 5) Monitoring (PODB / POTR)
  FE -> GW: POST /api/v1/po/dashboard/*
  FE -> GW: POST /api/v1/po/tracking/*
  GW -> PO: Forward
  PO -> PDB: Aggregate lifecycle data
  PO --> FE: dashboard + inquiry views
end

note over FE,PO
Detailed page diagrams:
- 10a-10f: master data
- 10g-10i: request flow
- 10j-10l: PO flow
- 10m-10p: fulfillment + finance
- 10q-10s: monitoring + closure
end note

@enduml
